    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>MARENO Glass Storage Jar | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover the MARENO Glass Storage Jar by INNA-Glas, a wide clear glass pantry jar with a natural cork lid, selected by KASODI for beautiful everyday organization."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>&middot;</span>
        <a href="/home/organization">Organization</a>
        <span>&middot;</span>
        <span>MARENO Glass Storage Jar</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/home-organization/inna-glas-mareno-glass-storage-jar.webp"
            alt="MARENO glass storage jar with cork lid by INNA-Glas styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            HOME ORGANIZATION &middot; FOOD STORAGE
          </p>

          <h1>
            MARENO Glass Storage Jar
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            INNA-Glas
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A generously proportioned clear glass storage jar with a wide,
            rounded silhouette and natural cork lid. Its simple combination
            of transparent glass and warm cork turns everyday pantry storage
            into something worth keeping on display.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Glass &middot; Cork</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Dimensions</span>
              <strong>&Oslash;24 &times; H17 cm</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Clear &middot; Natural cork</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Shape</span>
              <strong>Round</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Closure</span>
              <strong>Airtight cork lid</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Care</span>
              <strong>Hand wash</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://amzn.to/4AojSCa"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here &rarr;
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link &middot; KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            Storage becomes part of the room when the container itself is
            beautiful. The MARENO jar has an unusually broad, softly rounded
            silhouette that gives a simple glass vessel much more presence
            than a standard pantry jar.
          </p>

          <p>
            We like it filled with oats, granola, biscuits or other dry pantry
            staples and displayed on an open shelf or kitchen counter. The
            combination of clear glass and natural cork works especially well
            alongside wood, stone, linen and handmade ceramics.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Simple storage, thoughtfully displayed</h2>

        <p>
          The jar is listed for hand washing rather than dishwasher cleaning.
          Clean the glass gently and keep the natural cork lid from prolonged
          soaking to help preserve its appearance and fit.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Natural Wood</h3>
            <p>
              Wooden boards, utensils and trays echo the warmth of the cork
              lid and make pantry storage feel softer and more considered.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Textured Linen</h3>
            <p>
              Oatmeal, cream or softly striped linen adds texture while
              keeping the palette calm and natural.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Handmade Ceramics</h3>
            <p>
              Pair clear glass with tactile stoneware bowls and vessels for
              a pantry shelf that feels collected rather than purely practical.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>HOME ORGANIZATION</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/home-organization/textured-oval-organizer-tray"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/home-organization/blissilk-textured-oval-organizer-tray.webp"
                alt="Textured Oval Organizer Tray"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>ORGANIZATION</span>
              <h3>Textured Oval Organizer Tray</h3>
              <p>Blissilk</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/bathroom/amber-glass-apothecary-jars"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/kuishi-amber-glass-apothecary-jars.webp"
                alt="Amber Glass Apothecary Jars"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>STORAGE</span>
              <h3>Amber Glass Apothecary Jars</h3>
              <p>Kuishi</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/kitchen/nukha-acacia-toast-rack"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kitchen/kave-home-nukha-acacia-toast-rack.webp"
                alt="Nukha Acacia Toast Rack"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>KITCHEN</span>
              <h3>Nukha Acacia Toast Rack</h3>
              <p>Kave Home</p>
              <strong>Discover &rarr;</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          INNA-GLAS &middot; MARENO
        </p>

        <h2>
          Everyday storage made beautiful enough to display.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://amzn.to/4AojSCa"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here &rarr;
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link &middot; KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>